    "tree": {
      "sha": "d5972c6dd0eed3a1de44433753fa8cdde6953ecd",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jphacks/tkb_2615/git/trees/d5972c6dd0eed3a1de44433753fa8cdde6953ecd"
    },
    "message": "Give each live model check run its own usage account\n\nThe check reserved on one fixed account, live-task-qa, whose receipts\noutlive the run, so its 3-call cap covered the machine's lifetime and a\nsecond run was denied before any request (#148). Each run now opens\nlive-task-qa-<random> with the same caps; the machine-wide task\ncampaign ledger still bounds all runs together. The offline test runs\nthe case twice in one store and fails with a fixed account.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
